    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "复合幅值渐近线在每个转折频率处的斜率变化为整数：分子一阶项为 +1，分母一阶项为 -1，二阶项为 ±2。最低频段由 (jω)^n 项中的 n 决定。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The composite magnitude asymptote curve has integer slope changes at each break-point frequency: +1 for a first-order term in the numerator, -1 for a first-order term in the denominator, and ±2 for second-order terms. The lowest-frequency portion is determined by n in the (jω)^n term.",
